From 9dc5985f7ba37e637ee0093afb70dc68ffff1933 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:41:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix(allwinner): match A133 suspend CPU affinity

Match the stock monitor's CPU_OP word zero by validating the A133
single-cluster, four-core topology and passing only MPIDR AFF0. Normalize
architectural MPIDR metadata while rejecting unavailable cores, higher
affinities and reserved bits.

Assisted-by: LLM
